# Data

This folder contains the historical stock market data used for the analysis.

## Companies

* Apple (AAPL)
* Microsoft (MSFT)
* NVIDIA (NVDA)
* JPMorgan Chase (JPM)
* Coca-Cola (KO)

## Date Range

October 1, 2025 through October 1, 2026

## Variables

The datasets contain:

* Date
* Open
* High
* Low
* Close
* Adjusted Close
* Volume

The analysis primarily uses Adjusted Close to calculate stock returns and compare historical performance.

